were two twists the first is that there had been a massacre at the party and they'd been dragged into the shadow afterward, so they were seeing and dealing with the after effects of a massacre on the shadow. The second was the real twist, they had been the ones that massacred the other part attendants. Yes they were possessed but it was with their hands the dead was done.<br /> <br /> Introduction to wod mortal one shot","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-12T16:28:24-07:00","id":913069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/910980-the-most-frightening-story-in-cofd?p=913007#post913007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was either that or give Sinbad another TV Show.<br /> <br /> (Read: I'm referencing Freakazoid for lawls while I go over stories in my head.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I assumed you were talking about fetches, actually. I assumed players discovered everybody was a fetch, possibly including themselves.I can see that working well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http